---
description: >-
  Issue #673: `layout: dagre` (v12's name for `layered`) ignores the edge sides for placement,
  so architecture keeps `compass` (D556) and warns ARCHITECTURE_LAYOUT_IGNORED. Each `x:R --> L:y`
  puts y right of x: A, B, C on one row in G0, D and E on one row in G1 below C.
config:
  layout: dagre
---
architecture-beta
 group g0(cloud)[G0]
 service a(server)[A] in g0
 service b(server)[B] in g0
 service c(server)[C] in g0
 a:R --> L:b
 b:R --> L:c
 group g1(cloud)[G1]
 service d(server)[D] in g1
 service e(server)[E] in g1
 d:R --> L:e
 c:B --> T:d
